WEBVTT

00:53:27.937 --> 00:53:30.047
but they've still got
to have a school board,

00:53:30.071 --> 00:53:31.409
got to have a water council.

00:53:31.433 --> 00:53:34.225
So everybody, basically, has to get
involved in government,

00:53:34.249 --> 00:53:36.981
because there just are so many jobs
that need to get done.

00:53:37.005 --> 00:53:40.404
And I think it's very good for Nebraska
that people are really involved.

00:53:40.428 --> 00:53:43.729
CA: One of the things that I think
every community in the world today,

00:53:43.753 --> 00:53:47.482
every physical, real community
anchored in place, is probably facing

00:53:47.506 --> 00:53:50.788
is that there's these new
massive competitors

00:53:50.812 --> 00:53:53.069
for people's attention and time,

00:53:53.093 --> 00:53:56.747
aka technology in its different forms.

00:53:56.771 --> 00:53:59.430
I mean, Netflix is kind of awesome.

00:53:59.454 --> 00:54:00.968
The internet in general: